  <jpcrp_cor:PlannedAdditionsRetirementsEtcOfFacilitiesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h3 class="smt_head2"&gt;３ 【設備の新設、除却等の計画】&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(1) 重要な設備の新設等&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度末現在における重要な設備の新設等の計画はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(2) 重要な設備の除却等&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;経常的な設備の更新のための除却等を除き、重要な設備の除却等の計画はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:3pt;font-size:3pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:PlannedAdditionsRetirementsEtcOfFacilitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TotalNumberOfSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4"&gt;① 【株式の総数】&lt;/h5&gt;
